---
// Casamento Solidário — Charity donations section
---

<section id="solidarity" class="wedding-section bg-white">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Este é um casamento solidário!</h2>
			<div class="ornament">
				<img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/TM_LOGO.png`} alt="Logo" class="h-5 w-auto" />
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="text-center mb-10">
			<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
				Em vez das tradicionais lembranças de casamento, decidimos fazer donativos a instituições de solidariedade que nos são queridas. Se quiseres, podes também contribuir visitando os sites destas organizações.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Charity links -->
		<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<!-- Nariz Vermelho -->
			<a
				href="https://www.narizvermelho.pt/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="wedding-card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
			>
				<img
					src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/charities/nariz-vermelho-logo.png`}
					alt="Nariz Vermelho"
					class="max-h-[48px] w-auto object-contain"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<span class="text-xs text-olive-600 font-medium text-center">Nariz Vermelho</span>
			</a>

			<!-- Acreditar -->
			<a
				href="https://www.acreditar.org.pt/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="wedding-card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
			>
				<img
					src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/charities/acreditar-logo.png`}
					alt="Acreditar"
					class="max-h-[48px] w-auto object-contain"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<span class="text-xs text-olive-600 font-medium text-center">Acreditar</span>
			</a>

			<!-- Make-A-Wish -->
			<a
				href="https://makeawish.pt/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="wedding-card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
			>
				<img
					src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/charities/make-a-wish-logo.png`}
					alt="Make-A-Wish"
					class="max-h-[48px] w-auto object-contain"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<span class="text-xs text-olive-600 font-medium text-center">Make-A-Wish</span>
			</a>

			<!-- UNICEF -->
			<a
				href="https://unicef.pt/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="wedding-card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
			>
				<img
					src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/charities/unicef-logo.png`}
					alt="UNICEF"
					class="max-h-[48px] w-auto object-contain"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<span class="text-xs text-olive-600 font-medium text-center">UNICEF</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
